80	// ContainerEngineCheckedMsg reports whether a candidate container engine is
81	// not just installed but actually running. Missing means no binary was found
82	// at all; Err means the binary exists but its daemon did not answer — the
83	// distinction the app's own tool detection does not make today (it only
84	// checks the client, which answers even with the daemon down).
85	type ContainerEngineCheckedMsg struct {
86		Missing bool
